<title>BRAZIL: Brazil court postpones cellphone ruling to Thurs.</title>
<headline>Brazil court postpones cellphone ruling to Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Supreme Federal Tribunal (STF) has postponed until Thursday any decision on whether the B Band cellular phone tender is constitutional and should go ahead, a court spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the STF, Brazil's highest court, will meet to vote on the tender dispute at around 1400 local time/1700 GMT.</p>
<p>( -- Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5410))</p>
